%% Sequence: Khách đặt xe
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Khách hàng<br/>(Mobile/Web)
    participant API as NestJS API
    participant PR as PricingService
    participant R as RidesService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant EB as EventBus

    C->>API: POST /rides/quote<br/>{pickup, destination}
    API->>PR: estimate(pickup, destination)
    PR->>PR: OSRM route + surge calc
    PR-->>API: PricingEstimate
    API-->>C: 200 {estimate}

    C->>API: POST /rides<br/>{pickup, destination, estimate}
    API->>API: AuthGuard + validate
    API->>R: createRide(customerId, input)
    R->>DB: BEGIN
    R->>DB: INSERT rides (status=REQUESTED)
    R->>PR: lockSnapshot(rideId)
    PR->>DB: INSERT pricing_snapshots
    R->>DB: COMMIT
    R->>EB: emit ride.requested
    R-->>API: Ride{id, status=REQUESTED}
    API-->>C: 201 {ride}

    Note over EB: MatchingService<br/>lắng nghe<br/>(xem sequence 07)
